me\":\"socialcompute.dev\",\"url\":\"https://socialcompute.dev\",\"description\":\"Fully observable narrative simulations where every LLM call is logged, every agent decision is traceable, and the engine can override intent in real time.\"},{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"SocialCompute Engine\",\"applicationCategory\":\"Simulation\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Linux\",\"description\":\"Deterministic multi-agent LLM simulation engine with forced narrative coherence, epistemic routing, and full inference telemetry.\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/ComingSoon\"}}]}</script><nav class=\"border-b border-slate-800/50 px-6 py-4\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><img alt=\"socialcompute logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo-192.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-192.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo-192.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-slate-400 tracking-wider\">socialcompute<span class=\"text-emerald-400\">.dev</span></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm border border-emerald-400/40 text-emerald-400 px-3 py-1.5 sm:px-4 sm:py-2 hover:bg-emerald-400/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/manifesto\">[ MANIFESTO ]</a><a href=\"/deterministic_control_paper.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm border border-emerald-400/40 text-emerald-400 px-3 py-1.5 sm:px-4 sm:py-2 hover:bg-emerald-400/10 transition-colors\">[ PAPER ]</a></div></div></nav><section class=\"px-6 pt-24 pb-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6\"><span class=\"text-emerald-400\">user</span><span class=\"text-slate-600\">@</span><span class=\"text-slate-400\">socialcompute</span><span class=\"text-slate-600\">:~$ </span><span class=\"text-slate-300\">./engine --run</span><span class=\"inline-block w-2 h-4 bg-emerald-400/80 ml-1 animate-pulse align-text-bottom\"></span></p><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-100 mb-6\">Deterministic Multi-Agent Engine</h1><p class=\"text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10\">Fully observable narrative simulations where every LLM call is logged, every agent decision is traceable, and the engine can override intent in real time. No black boxes \u2014 just deterministic drama.</p><a href=\"#directory\" class=\"inline-block font-mono text-sm border border-emerald-400/40 text-emerald-400 px-6 py-3 hover:bg-emerald-400/10 transition-colors\">[ ACCESS SIMULATION RECORDS ]</a></section><section id=\"directory\" class=\"px-6 pb-24 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-8\">Simulation Directory</p><div class=\"border border-slate-800 bg-[#111827] rounded-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-800/60\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400\"></div><span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-emerald-400 tracking-wider\">STATUS: ACTIVE</span></div><span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-slate-600\">EXP_01</span></div><div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"EXP_01: Locked House \u2014 simulation poster\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fposter.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fposter.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fposter.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fposter.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fposter.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fposter.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fposter.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fposter.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fposter.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"px-6 py-6 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"font-mono text-lg text-slate-200 tracking-tight\">EXP_01: LOCKED_HOUSE</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-xl\">Eight autonomous agents wake up in a locked rural house \u2014 one of them is already dead. The engine enforces physical constraints, resource depletion, and emotional pressure while every agent believes they are acting of their own free will.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-amber-400/80 border border-amber-400/20 px-2 py-1\">[PRESSURE_COOKER_LEAK]</span><span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-amber-400/80 border border-amber-400/20 px-2 py-1\">[DETERMINISTIC_DISCOVERY]</span></div><div class=\"pt-4\"><a class=\"inline-block font-mono text-sm border border-emerald-400/40 text-emerald-400 px-5 py-2.5 hover:bg-emerald-400/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/simulation-murder-locked-house\">[ VIEW TIMELINE &amp; TELEMETRY ]</a></div></div></div></section><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-24 mb-12 px-6\"><div class=\"p-4 border-l-2 border-slate-700 text-slate-400 font-mono text-sm opacity-90\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500/70 font-bold mb-2 block\">&gt;&gt; INFRASTRUCTURE_NOTE</span><p class=\"leading-relaxed\">All simulations documented on this portal are powered by a custom, high-efficiency orchestration engine built explicitly for generative LLM multi-agent environments. The architecture runs on local compute, prioritizing deterministic latency control, strict context isolation, and absolute traceability across every inference cycle. Zero black boxes. Total narrative state control.</p><div class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"inline-block font-mono text-sm border border-emerald-400/40 text-emerald-400 px-5 py-2.5 hover:bg-emerald-400/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/manifesto\">[ READ ENGINEERING MANIFESTO ]</a></div></div></div><footer class=\"border-t border-slate-800/50 px-6 py-8 space-y-3\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs text-slate-600 text-center\">Engine architecture by Marcos. Hosted locally for deterministic latency control.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-4\"><a href=\"mailto:pazzarelli.marcos@gmail.com\" class=\"font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\">pazzarelli.marcos@gmail.com</a><a href=\"https://x.com/MarcosPimi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Follow @MarcosPimi on X\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/deterministic_control_paper.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\">[ PAPER PDF ]</a></div></footer></main><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/f1b4d49aa9e249c5.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[2355,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/a624b468970d3cc4.js\\\"],\\\"Analytics\\\"]\\n5:I[5500,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/a624b468970d3cc4.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/f3dad40ac80f1407.js\\\"],\\\"Image\\\"